---
config:
  theme: dark
---
graph TD
    User -->|Views Dashboard| UI[React Dashboard App]
    
    subgraph DataVisualizationFlow[Data Visualization Flow]
        UI -->|On Load/Refresh| FetchLogs[GET /getData]
        FetchLogs -->|Success| SetState[Set logData, Loading: false]
        FetchLogs -->|Error| HandleError[Handle Error, Reset State]
        SetState -->|Process Data| ProcessData[constructGraphData]
        ProcessData -->|Render| Chart["Render Interactive Charts (Chart.js)"]
    end
    
    subgraph PredictionFlow[AI Prediction Flow]
        UI -->|Select Date/Type & Click Run| TriggerPredict[Trigger getPredictions]
        TriggerPredict -->|POST /predict| APIPredict[POST /predict]
        APIPredict -->|Pending| SetLoading[setIsPredicting: true]
        APIPredict -->|Success| SetResult[Set predictionResponse, isPredicting: false]
        SetResult -->|Display| UIResult["Display Prediction Result"]
    end
